# The build context holds only what the image needs: the three source folders, the licence and the
# one model folder that the workflow puts in model/. Everything else is out.
*
!LICENSE
!backend
!frontend
!ml
!model/clauseanchor_candidate_v0

# Environments, build output, caches and the generated map folders (backend/*-out), wherever they sit
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.vite
**/.screens
**/*-out

# Model folders, weights and archives, wherever they sit
**/models
**/*.zip
**/*.safetensors
**/*.pt
**/*.onnx
**/*.bin

# Secrets and local config
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The one model folder the workflow places on purpose. This line stays last, so it wins over the
# weight patterns above.
!model/clauseanchor_candidate_v0
